7
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:28,450
Are you asking me to accept this?

8
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:31,160
If you think of Yumi

9
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:33,910
This is the most realistic choice

10
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:37,330
With just love

11
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:40,160
I can't protect everything

12
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:28,340
I don't need that kind of choice

13
00:01:29,420 --> 00:01:30,720
Yumi, you

