I'll decide

45
00:03:39,260 --> 00:03:40,300
Still

46
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:43,100
I felt really relieved when my sister said that

47
00:03:43,100 --> 00:03:45,220
at the café earlier

48
00:03:46,770 --> 00:03:48,650
What did I say?

49
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:54,610
The time spent with this person is more important, you know

50
00:03:57,070 --> 00:03:57,950
That

