64
00:04:52,130 --> 00:04:53,000
Then

65
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:55,550
Please don't let go

66
00:04:57,670 --> 00:04:58,420
Don't worry

67
00:05:07,260 --> 00:05:09,390
I like you, Gaeun

68
00:06:58,460 --> 00:07:04,130
